---
// The h1 lives in the rail (the name); this is the page's thesis statement.
// Note: keep inline <b>/<span> on the same line as the word before them —
// Astro trims whitespace at line breaks next to elements, which would glue
// words together ("advertisers20% YoY").
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="hero-greeting">Hi, I'm Vikas Peraka.</p>
    <h2 class="hero-title">
      Software used by a billion people.<br />
      Growth work that <span class="g">moves revenue</span>.
    </h2>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Six years at Meta: the account settings behind <b>Facebook, Instagram, Messenger and Quest</b> for <span class="num">1B+ people</span>, ad products that grew Marketplace advertisers <span class="num">20% YoY</span>, and storefront work that lifted Meta AI glasses sales <span class="num">5% YoY</span>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
